## 2. Playbook für Systemhaus-Admins (MSP Super-Tenant)

### A. Endpoint-Hardening & Remediation Workflow
Wenn Endkunden-Nodes Compliance-Abweichungen melden, liefert das System direkt ausführbare Remediation-Befehle im Dashboard oder via REST-API.

1. **Hardening-Report senden (Client/Agent-Perspektive)**:
   POST-Payload an `/api/v1/hardening/report` senden.

```json
{
  "node_id": "srv-prod-db-01",
  "success": false,
  "open_issues": 2,
  "failed_controls": [
    {
      "control_id": "CIS-3.2.2",
      "description": "Ensure IP forwarding is disabled",
      "remediation_cmd": "sysctl -w net.ipv4.ip_forward=0"
    },
    {
      "control_id": "CIS-5.2.10",
      "description": "Ensure SSH Root Login is disabled",
      "remediation_cmd": "sed -i 's/^PermitRootLogin.*/PermitRootLogin no/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config && systemctl reload sshd"
    }
  ]
}